  * One full-frame BGRA layer (what backboardd swaps): the GPU scales the whole
  * iOS frame (1125x2436) to fit the panel (1053x2280 at x 13), instead of the
@@ -440,15 +498,18 @@ AppleCLCD::presentGPU(const uint8_t *rec)
